        "file": "graph.py",
        "claim": "The returned cycle is not guaranteed to start with the lexicographically smallest target on the cycle when the DFS path suffix contains the cycle nodes in an order where the smallest node is not the first element after rotation, because rotate_cycle only rotates the path suffix and does not verify that the rotated sequence still satisfies the required dependency direction for all elements.",
        "severity": "medium",
        "status": "dropped",
        "investigation": "no deterministic repro; dropped (not repaired)"
